      "enemyWounded": 0,
      "units": [
        "1 APC Squadron, 3 Cavalry Regiment",
        "1 Field Squadron",
        "D \u0026 E Platoon, 1 Australian Task Force",
        "D Company, 5 Battalion, Royal Australian Regiment"
      ],
      "subUnits": [],
      "report": "D Coy of 5 RAR was conducting an sweep of NE section of Hoa Long searching for enemy mortar positions. Elements of its force received light mortar rounds resulting in 2 cas from D and E pl, 1 from 1 APC Sqn, and 1 from 1Fd Sqn. 1 Aust killed 3 wounded.\n\nYS438643: EN MORTAR AT LOC STATED. ENGAGED BY ARTY. RESUNK.\n\nThe en mortars located by AN/KPQ1 Radar at Long Phuoc village. (1ATF Sitrep 12/6/66)",
      "archivalSource": "Cmdr"
    },
