      "enemyKilled": 0,
      "enemyWounded": 0,
      "units": [
        "1 Field Squadron"
      ],
      "subUnits": [],
      "report": "Bulldozer driver injured by RPG. 2 enemy fired an RPG-2 and SA at bulldozer wounding the driver and setting fire to the dozer. Driver suffered head and chest wds.\n\nThe land clearing team was operating around Nui Thi Vai and the Nui Dinh Mountains. An enemy fired an RPG at the D8 bulldozer setting it on fire and wounding the operator with shrapnel to the head, chest and legs (Sapper W Edwards). The engineers could not put the fire out in the bulldozer, so pushed it into a cutting and buried it with soil. After extinguishing the flames the dozer was withdrawn to Nui Dat the next day.\n(Hist of 1 Fd Sqn p214-15; 4 RAR Diary AWM95, 7/4/30.pdf p15-16.)",
      "archivalSource": "AWM95 7-4-30.pdf pg15-16; AWM95 7-4-31.pdf pg137 Contact Rept; Intsum, AWM95 1/4/113 pt3.pdf p3;"
    },
