      "subUnits": [],
      "report": "YS452577, YS452581: AT LOCS STATED, IN TAM PHOUC,2 X LCT VEHICLES DETONATED 3 X M-16 MINES. RES 3 AUST WIA,2 DOZERS SLIGHTLY DAMAGED.\n\nOne dozer ran over an M16 mine injuring the driver and one soldier walking behind. A second dozer ran over another M16 mine slightly damaging the radiator and the driver. Cas were evac 1 had light shrap to R thigh, another had minor shrap to L thigh, the third had minor shrap wd to scalp.\n\nEdge of village SE of Long Dien",
